WEBVTT

00:03.253 --> 00:05.588
<i>Causes of death are many and varied.</i>

00:06.089 --> 00:09.259
<i>Old age, suicide, illness…</i>

00:09.759 --> 00:14.389
<i>But the cause of death that scares</i>
<i>the most people in this day and age…</i>

00:19.185 --> 00:20.270
<i>…is death by fire.</i>

00:28.153 --> 00:30.363
<i>The captain of</i>
<i>Special Fire Force Company 8,</i>

00:30.447 --> 00:32.991
<i>Akitaru Obi, has been arrested.</i>

00:33.074 --> 00:36.870
<i>The Imperial Army is in pursuit of all</i>
<i>crewmen in Special Fire Force Company 8</i>

00:36.953 --> 00:39.831
<i>as key witnesses to the crime.</i>

00:41.416 --> 00:45.420
The country's turned into
a fire scene full of enemies.

00:46.212 --> 00:51.384
As an older outlaw, I'll teach you
how to walk through the darkness.

00:51.968 --> 00:53.928
<i>Human combustion is a tribulation brought</i>

00:54.012 --> 00:58.850
<i>upon us for humanity to reach the Sun.</i>

00:59.350 --> 01:02.979
<i>Having overcome the tribulation,</i>
<i>humanity will become the Sun</i>

01:03.063 --> 01:05.065
<i>and return to the great flame.</i>

01:05.148 --> 01:07.317
Can we trust Joker?

01:07.984 --> 01:12.989
If you can trust me,
then you can trust him.

01:13.073 --> 01:15.784
He's the dark hero of Tokyo.

01:16.785 --> 01:20.789
And Obi isn't the only
light that I've found.

01:21.289 --> 01:24.292
You're one too, Shinra Kusakabe.

01:25.710 --> 01:27.462
You do not need to give me money.

01:27.962 --> 01:30.673
Yes, I will let you out soon.

01:31.257 --> 01:34.552
But only after
you have become an Infernal.

01:34.636 --> 01:37.514
Get us in there with a bang.

01:37.597 --> 01:39.349
Don't need to tell me that!

02:00.829 --> 02:02.497
Captain Obi…

04:08.873 --> 04:10.875
Where's Captain Obi?!

04:13.211 --> 04:15.088
Akitaru Obi…

04:15.588 --> 04:18.007
He has served the great Sol faithfully.

04:18.091 --> 04:20.301
As a reward, he shall
return to the flame of fire.

04:23.471 --> 04:25.640
Why, Captain Burns?!

04:25.723 --> 04:26.724
Why would you do this?!

04:28.393 --> 04:35.149
I have given my whole life
to fulfill my duty to serve God.

04:36.734 --> 04:40.488
However, in that Adolla Link,

04:40.571 --> 04:43.992
I began to doubt the Holy Sol Temple.

05:10.685 --> 05:15.857
<i>And now, I have felt the Evangelist,</i>
<i>a god that I cannot doubt,</i>

05:16.441 --> 05:18.776
<i>a truth in which I can have faith.</i>

05:19.277 --> 05:24.699
<i>Thus, giving my self to that god</i>
<i>is how I should live.</i>

05:30.330 --> 05:35.293
True, that Adolla was something
like the world of a god.

05:35.960 --> 05:42.091
But I haven't given anything to any gods.
I can't see it as right in any way.

05:42.175 --> 05:47.096
The White-Clad are trying to recreate the
Great Cataclysm and destroy the world!

05:48.473 --> 05:51.142
After destruction comes creation.

05:52.268 --> 05:54.187
Destruction is not the end.

05:54.687 --> 05:59.817
Before God, human reason
is naught but egotism.

05:59.901 --> 06:02.737
Then what about the people of Tokyo
that you've saved for so long?

06:11.537 --> 06:14.665
Sacrifices must be made for any cause.

06:17.418 --> 06:20.880
And the greater the cause,
the greater the sacrifice.

06:21.881 --> 06:22.882
Captain!

06:26.094 --> 06:28.179
Akitaru Obi…

06:28.262 --> 06:34.018
What will we gain in exchange
for losing a great man?

06:37.396 --> 06:40.983
Is that what you actually believe?!

07:17.019 --> 07:19.230
VOLTAGE NOVA

07:45.548 --> 07:47.675
The longer the fight continues,

07:47.758 --> 07:51.679
the more Burns's heat will continue
to build and increase.

08:01.856 --> 08:07.320
The longer we take, the stronger
he'll get. He'll become unstoppable.

08:14.827 --> 08:18.915
<i>What is Captain Burns thinking?</i>

08:29.717 --> 08:32.720
<i>Why would a Fire Soldier who fights fires…</i>

08:33.513 --> 08:35.139
<i>For the longest time…</i>

08:38.476 --> 08:41.187
<i>I had thought of you like my own father…</i>

08:42.730 --> 08:45.816
Why did you have to change?

08:46.400 --> 08:49.362
You won't even give
me time to ask you that?!

09:05.753 --> 09:07.296
The 8th is coming.

09:08.172 --> 09:10.216
This is my responsibility.

09:10.883 --> 09:13.511
Perhaps you can leave in the meantime.

09:14.428 --> 09:15.888
All right.

09:15.972 --> 09:18.766
We'll leave a Destroyer with you.

09:19.934 --> 09:23.563
I will engage the Fourth Pillar.

09:34.740 --> 09:36.784
What's wrong, Haumea?

09:39.161 --> 09:43.791
I'm just kinda tired. Quit making
a big deal of things. Just shut up.

09:52.091 --> 09:54.385
Turn the Earth into the Sun?!

09:54.969 --> 10:01.350
Whatever Great Cataclysms happen, there's
no way to turn this planet into the Sun!

10:01.434 --> 10:03.853
Their whole schtick's just a cult!

10:03.936 --> 10:05.354
Like hell I'll believe it!

10:07.106 --> 10:12.862
Why would Captain Burns assist the
White-Clad and their moronic nonsense?

10:13.779 --> 10:19.201
Perhaps the Adolla world that he
once saw was that shocking to him.

10:19.285 --> 10:22.330
But he believes this turning
the Earth into the Sun schtick?!

10:27.001 --> 10:30.880
We act from our faith in God.

10:31.422 --> 10:34.258
The same holds true for Captain Burns.

10:34.842 --> 10:39.221
Sure, but capturing
Captain Obi is plain wrong.

10:58.407 --> 11:00.409
We'll reach Fuchu shortly!

11:00.493 --> 11:01.702
Time for a fight!

11:02.370 --> 11:04.872
We're arriving after Shinra and Joker.

11:04.955 --> 11:05.790
Prepare to engage!

11:11.796 --> 11:14.173
U-Um…

11:15.508 --> 11:18.135
It's dangerous to stand
while we're moving.

11:18.219 --> 11:20.388
You always tell us that--

11:20.471 --> 11:22.056
Shut up.

11:22.640 --> 11:27.228
We're insurgents now! We can stick
hands out windows or anything we want!

11:27.311 --> 11:28.771
There will be no holds barred.

11:28.854 --> 11:31.524
We are going under the assumption
that we will obliterate Fuchu Prison.

11:32.400 --> 11:34.735
Blow the shit out of the prison!

11:35.528 --> 11:39.532
I feel like… maybe he didn't only become
an insurgent a few hours ago.

11:39.615 --> 11:41.742
Yeah… He's too used to it…

11:41.826 --> 11:42.952
What's wrong?!

11:43.035 --> 11:44.829
Quit being so quiet and docile!

11:44.912 --> 11:46.747
Blow the shit out of the prison!

11:50.084 --> 11:52.420
B-Blow the shit out of the prison!

11:52.503 --> 11:53.963
I can't hear you!

11:54.046 --> 11:55.756
Blow the shit out of the prison!

11:55.840 --> 11:57.675
Blow the shit out of the prison!

11:57.758 --> 11:58.592
I still can't hear you!

11:58.676 --> 12:00.678
Blow the shit out of the prison!

12:00.761 --> 12:01.595
One more time!

12:01.679 --> 12:04.181
Blow the shit out of the prison!

12:12.815 --> 12:16.861
Burns once experienced an Adolla Link.
Why allow him to live?

12:17.445 --> 12:21.574
Haumea needs him for this playground.

12:21.657 --> 12:24.827
She intends to have him
link with a doppelganger.

12:26.495 --> 12:29.874
We are to repel the rest of the 8th.

12:31.333 --> 12:35.588
The darkness of despair
shall lead this planet to the Sun.

12:36.172 --> 12:39.925
We will destroy them together
with despair.

12:41.677 --> 12:43.554
Where is Haumea?

12:44.805 --> 12:47.308
She is in the Sanctuary in the Nether.

12:47.391 --> 12:50.102
She is collecting the
Collective Unconscious.

13:09.747 --> 13:15.753
Ah, my body is always so troublesome.

13:16.545 --> 13:18.631
-Yona…
-Charon.

13:23.260 --> 13:28.015
It seems that the Collective Unconscious
is collecting smoothly in Haumea.

13:29.642 --> 13:31.227
I can't bear to watch.

13:31.810 --> 13:36.482
We have reached the age
when pi can be deciphered.

13:36.565 --> 13:38.192
The time is nigh.

13:41.487 --> 13:46.742
I don't care when it is, as long as
I don't need to see Haumea suffer.

14:01.966 --> 14:05.594
SPECIAL FIRE FORCE COMBINE 5

14:07.263 --> 14:11.392
It seems Princess is not about?

14:11.892 --> 14:15.563
Princess has been in the laboratory
since she returned.

14:16.730 --> 14:18.274
The laboratory?

14:20.693 --> 14:22.987
Speaking Infernals…

14:23.070 --> 14:25.865
Miyamoto… Demons…

14:26.532 --> 14:28.951
And doppelgangers…

14:34.874 --> 14:38.294
Why does my investigation
lead me to this place?

14:39.420 --> 14:45.593
Was the convent where Iris and I
were raised part of some experiment?!

14:50.264 --> 14:53.934
Someone started the fire that
immolated the sisters intentionally.

14:54.018 --> 14:59.732
And that is related
to doppelgangers in some form.

15:01.692 --> 15:03.319
Then that means…

15:06.322 --> 15:09.450
Burns is handling the Fourth Pillar.

15:09.533 --> 15:12.494
The others from the 8th
should arrive shortly.

15:12.995 --> 15:14.622
I see.

15:14.705 --> 15:17.791
Then we shall destroy them.

15:19.251 --> 15:23.923
Their strategy is to use
the Fourth Pillar as a diversion.

15:24.423 --> 15:26.842
We do not know from where they will enter.

15:26.926 --> 15:28.302
Watch the back entrance intently.

15:29.678 --> 15:33.057
This wall… They will not enter
through the front.

15:52.326 --> 15:54.411
Find Captain Obi!

15:54.954 --> 15:58.123
Crush anyone who gets in the way,
no questions asked!

15:59.208 --> 16:00.834
They came in through the front.

16:00.918 --> 16:03.545
An excellent act, Gold.

16:05.923 --> 16:07.675
They found us already, Lieutenant.

16:07.758 --> 16:09.760
-What?
-You thought they wouldn't?

16:11.929 --> 16:15.391
Vulcan, stand by at the rear.
Provide backup with Licht.

16:15.474 --> 16:16.392
Got it!

16:16.475 --> 16:19.687
Arthur, you stand at the front.
We'll observe their movements.

16:22.815 --> 16:23.816
Arthur?

16:25.359 --> 16:28.612
Oh, right. I haven't seen him in a while.

16:28.696 --> 16:31.156
Did he fall off the truck
while we were moving?!

16:31.240 --> 16:35.577
You've gotta be kidding me.
Who takes the front without him?

16:36.078 --> 16:40.249
This is why I always said
not to stand while moving.

16:40.916 --> 16:43.335
They came in through the front.

16:43.419 --> 16:46.380
They did not have much time
to develop a plan.

16:48.298 --> 16:51.051
The toll will be your lives.

16:51.135 --> 16:52.302
Cha-ching.

16:52.970 --> 16:57.307
Who will take the front? We don't
have Shinra or Arthur or the captain.

16:57.391 --> 16:59.268
It'll have to be you and me.

16:59.351 --> 17:00.894
I'll take the front!

17:02.938 --> 17:05.649
I'm resistant to flames! I'll do it!

17:06.692 --> 17:07.609
Tamaki…

17:11.280 --> 17:15.367
The enemy might not fight
only with flames! Be careful!

17:16.243 --> 17:20.080
Leave it to me! My top speed
isn't as high as Shinra's,

17:20.164 --> 17:21.707
but I'm far more nimble!

17:22.666 --> 17:23.917
Time is of the essence!

17:26.545 --> 17:29.048
One more person pays the toll.

17:29.131 --> 17:29.965
Cha-ching.

17:30.549 --> 17:33.177
Maki! We provide cover for Tamaki!

17:33.260 --> 17:34.386
Roger!

17:35.596 --> 17:38.599
Licht, do you have a visual?
Can you see them?

17:38.682 --> 17:42.770
This is the other side of the wall.
The picture is clear.

17:42.853 --> 17:44.688
I have a visual on the enemy.

17:44.772 --> 17:47.900
<i>The three of us provide</i>
<i>backup for the others!</i>

17:47.983 --> 17:49.526
Leave it to me!

17:54.740 --> 17:56.533
This'll do it!

17:57.159 --> 17:59.286
You think you can hit me from above?

18:01.747 --> 18:04.374
Take this! Nekomata--

18:07.002 --> 18:08.879
Tamaki! Get out of there now!

18:12.841 --> 18:14.218
<i>They reflected them?!</i>

18:14.301 --> 18:15.677
Maki! Take control of it!

18:15.761 --> 18:16.887
Yes, sir!

18:17.679 --> 18:19.348
A powerful second-generation…

18:21.058 --> 18:22.559
But it is futile.

18:23.560 --> 18:24.895
Maki-san!

18:32.111 --> 18:35.405
I failed to collect the toll.

18:35.906 --> 18:36.740
No matter.

18:37.324 --> 18:39.243
Thank you, sir.

18:39.326 --> 18:41.245
Were you able to interfere
with their pyrokinesis?

18:41.954 --> 18:47.209
I felt something in their right arm,
but it was more like heat than flame.

18:47.292 --> 18:49.169
I couldn't take control of it.

18:52.214 --> 18:57.010
We Destroyers are experts
against pyrokinetic opponents.

18:57.594 --> 18:59.805
You are quite a powerful
second-generation pyrokinetic,

18:59.888 --> 19:01.849
but you cannot handle us.

19:15.946 --> 19:18.532
Damn. That's fast.

19:20.909 --> 19:23.912
He's already in stage two.

19:25.581 --> 19:29.376
At this rate, we'll have
no means to fight him.

19:30.127 --> 19:34.464
Well, I hope we aren't too late already.

19:40.846 --> 19:43.473
Licht!
Have you figured out the enemy's power?

19:43.557 --> 19:47.686
The secret has to be
that golden right arm.

19:47.769 --> 19:49.229
That's all I've got right now.

19:49.938 --> 19:52.900
But I'll find an explanation soon.

19:52.983 --> 19:56.486
Battle and analysis is how
the Special Fire Force fights.

19:56.570 --> 19:57.696
That's right.

19:58.322 --> 19:59.907
He'll have an analysis soon!

20:01.658 --> 20:04.661
-We regroup and revise.
-Yes, sir!

20:05.245 --> 20:08.081
What? Deciding how to pay?

20:08.165 --> 20:10.500
Bribery will not work on me.

20:11.084 --> 20:13.670
The end of your money
is the end of your life.

20:13.754 --> 20:17.257
I am more than enough to handle you.

20:20.302 --> 20:21.720
I'll take her on!

20:21.803 --> 20:25.390
Hey! You're gonna regret ever
underestimating the 8th, damn you!

20:25.474 --> 20:27.142
It doesn't matter how
many of you there are.

20:27.226 --> 20:29.645
We're pushing through here either way!

20:29.728 --> 20:30.729
Let's go!

20:31.313 --> 20:35.525
The toll is the Company 8 spirit
that Captain Obi trained us in!

20:38.028 --> 20:42.950
TO BE CONTINUED

22:14.499 --> 22:15.459
NEXT TIME

22:16.293 --> 22:17.544
<i>How unsightly.</i>

22:17.627 --> 22:19.588
<i>Licht-san will come up with something!</i>

22:19.671 --> 22:23.175
<i>That was close!</i>
<i>Saved by my lucky lecher lure!</i>

22:23.258 --> 22:25.177
<i>Next time, "Gold's Secret."</i>

22:25.260 --> 22:27.763
<i>Return to the great flame of fire.</i> Látom.
